### Test Authors API
### Base URL: http://localhost:3226

### 1. Seed Authors (Run this FIRST before seeding books)
POST http://localhost:3226/authors/seed
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get All Authors
GET http://localhost:3226/authors

###

### 3. Get Author Stats (with book count)
GET http://localhost:3226/authors/stats

###

### 4. Create a New Author
POST http://localhost:3226/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Robert",
  "last_name": "Martin",
  "bio": "Clean Code author and software craftsmanship advocate",
  "email": "robert.martin@example.com",
  "country": "USA",
  "birth_date": "1952-12-05"
}

###

### 5. Get Author by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3226/authors/65c123456789abcdef123456

###

### 6. Update Author (replace with actual ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3226/authors/65c123456789abcdef123456
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Updated biography",
  "country": "Canada"
}

###

### 7. Delete Author (replace with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3226/authors/65c123456789abcdef123456

###

### === BOOKS WITH AUTHORS ===

### 8. Seed Books (After seeding authors)
POST http://localhost:3226/books/seed

###

### 9. Get All Books with Author Details
GET http://localhost:3226/books/with-authors

###

### 10. Get Single Book with Author (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3226/books/65c123456789abcdef123456

###
